Package: hearth
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), curl, xdg-utils
Recommends: poppler-utils
Maintainer: dprice0823 <269845988+dprice0823@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/dprice0823/hearth
Description: Private, local AI chat for Ollama
 Hearth is a private AI assistant that runs entirely on your own computer,
 talking to local models through Ollama. It gives you a browser chat window
 with tools, web access, long-term memory, a jailed coding workspace and
 optional local image generation.
 .
 It listens on 127.0.0.1 only, so nothing you type or share ever leaves your
 machine, and there is no account or login. Your chats, memory and settings
 are stored per-user under ~/.local/share/hearth.
 .
 Hearth needs Ollama (https://ollama.com) to run the actual models; Ollama is
 not packaged here and must be installed separately.
